From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:31:04 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 194/230] feat(dateStrip): 21-day scrollable strip with
 auto-center on today and selected day
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The matchday strip showed five chips that filled the width, so days more
than three ahead were unreachable. It now carries two weeks back and one
week forward on a swipeable row, and lands on today instead of the far
end of the window.

